        "content": "<p>Rocco can now finally do web builds, which is achieved by Roc compiling to wasm and the engine supporting WebGPU. I have embedded an example on this post inspired by the classic PS1 game <strong>Kula World</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-11-17 at 8.35.50 AM.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1371x861\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/22008/bwrA-VPuVq8JU7hzzcn6k8EN/Screenshot-2026-11-17-at-8.35.50AM.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/22008/bwrA-VPuVq8JU7hzzcn6k8EN/Screenshot-2026-11-17-at-8.35.50AM.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pixelsprout.dev/devlog/rocco-on-the-web/\">https://pixelsprout.dev/devlog/rocco-on-the-web/</a></p>",
        "id": 640848041,
