        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"1009034\">Steve Howell</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/304902-show-and-tell/topic/Rocco.20on.20the.20web.21/near/641277220\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm getting better at OrbWeaver:</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Haha maybe I should add some more levels then <span aria-label=\"sweat smile\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f605\" role=\"img\" title=\"sweat smile\">:sweat_smile:</span></p>\n<p>I'm not using anything too fancy, just Monaco for the editor and the plain old JavaScript and CSS for the rest. I'm also using the Roc interpreter inside the wasm bundle.</p>",
